\newlabel{fig:score-trends}{{4}{12}{CIFAR-10 non-IID FR3: mean paired scores over complete evidence cycles through round 80 (lines), with client interquartile intervals shaded. Scores are first averaged over A/B per client. Bands show client dispersion, NOT mean uncertainty. References/MAD scales change each cycle; z-score changes need not match raw-norm changes. Free-rider curves stop at removal, never zero-filled. Class colors are for evaluation only}{figure.4}{}}
