\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Actual per-round durations over 100 executed rounds for both methods. Our trajectories include changing active-client counts and probing schedules; STD-DAGMM retains all 100 clients. Markers indicate full-cycle decisions, not their isolated computational cost. Axis scales differ by dataset.}}{17}{figure.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:timing-traces}{{9}{17}{Actual per-round durations over 100 executed rounds for both methods. Our trajectories include changing active-client counts and probing schedules; STD-DAGMM retains all 100 clients. Markers indicate full-cycle decisions, not their isolated computational cost. Axis scales differ by dataset}{figure.9}{}}
